<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar management committee sets molasses duties.</title>
<headline>EU sugar management committee sets molasses duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday set new reference prices for cane and beet molasses imports but duties were unchanged, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There was a fall in the refence prices but duties are unchanged from last week,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The committee fixed the reference price for cane molasses at 7.32 ecus per 100 kg compared with 7.50 last week.</p>
<p>Import duty for cane molasses remains at 0.41 ecus per 100 kg.</p>
<p>The reference price for beet molasses was fixed at 11.38 ecus per 100 kg compared with 11.42 ecus last week.</p>
<p>The import duty for beet remains suspended at zero.</p>
</text>
